      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: Nell coughs, and pulls out her journal. The air hangs heavy with the
          scent of must and mildew. Space is empty, carrying with it only a sense
          of acrid loneliness.
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Sequence
        value: 
        type: 0
